From 9ad64101f54753b37a6d237d15cd55055a8b1e5c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: albanread <albanread@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 22 Sep 2026 19:41:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Retro: a demo of the game pane

An indexed sky whose colour comes from the scanline palette, so a raster
bar costs one palette write a line rather than a repaint; hills drawn a
column at a time; a keyed blit; and a sprite the host scales and turns.
1, 2 and 3 switch the filter between plain, scanlines and a tube.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
